-- words --
A runner's change that only deletes files under a goals/X/ folder of no Goal passes Own path: H0 holds goals/draft-x/f, a runner's commit deletes it, and hyp run on that commit runs.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=runner-1 HYP_ROLE=runner hyp run ROW GOAL/line-1
-- floor: contains --
ran GOAL line-1 at
-- ceiling --
Own path
